### GymSync API — example HTTP requests
### Requires REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Register
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1!",
  "name": "Demo User"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1!"
}

### List exercises
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises?page=0&size=20&sort=name,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start workout
# @name startWorkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Complete workout
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/workouts/{{startWorkout.response.body.$.id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Weekly stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Import notes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rawText": "Bench 3x8 135 lb, Squat 5x5 185 lb"
}
